<title>USA: Galileo gets OK to market medical device.</title>
<headline>Galileo gets OK to market medical device.</headline>
<dateline>STURBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Galileo Corp said Friday it has received 510k marketing approval from the Food and Drug Administration to market its rigid Hysteroscopes used during gynecological procedures.</p>
<p>The devices are used for direct visualization of the cervical canal and uterine cavity during diagnostic and surgical procedures.</p>
